    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Max Zekill"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "The Max Zekill identity connects poetry, rap, sung text, lyric videos, freestyles, and public releases. Some works are intimate, some are socially charged, and some simply preserve the joy of making words move with sound. The public archive is distributed mainly across YouTube and SoundCloud."
      }
