        "level": 2,
        "text": "Creative Position"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "I do not present music here as a claim of celebrity. I present it as a trace of authorship and courage: the decision to speak, to perform, to publish, to accept imperfection, and to let a part of one's inner world meet an audience."
      }
